From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 22:35:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Composer: the presets strip hides on a short tablet; a
 long-prompt screenshot check (owner bug 2026-11-14)

Android already caps the prompt (120 dp phone, 96 dp tablet) and the Rig scrolls
inside its panel. On a short screen (under 720 dp) the presets strip no longer
takes the stage's room. SuiteLongPromptTest: a ~1,500-character prompt on Shot
and Photo, phone / tablet / landscape tablet, the Rig's first rows on screen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Py2rxoXQmfbR7CXwb939GC
---
 .../screens/suite/composer/ComposerScreen.kt  |  4 +-
 .../studio/muse/app/SuiteLongPromptTest.kt    | 81 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 android/app/src/test/kotlin/studio/muse/app/SuiteLongPromptTest.kt

diff --git a/android/app/src/main/kotlin/studio/muse/app/ui/screens/suite/composer/ComposerScreen.kt b/android/app/src/main/kotlin/studio/muse/app/ui/screens/suite/composer/ComposerScreen.kt
index 925e68ed..1e65f201 100644
--- a/android/app/src/main/kotlin/studio/muse/app/ui/screens/suite/composer/ComposerScreen.kt
+++ b/android/app/src/main/kotlin/studio/muse/app/ui/screens/suite/composer/ComposerScreen.kt
@@ -1123,7 +1123,9 @@ private fun WideComposer(ui: ComposerUi, job: studio.muse.app.data.Job?, recent:
             }
         }
         if (ui.catalogNote != null) CatalogNote(ui)
-        else if (ui.photo == null && (presets || ui.d.collapsed)) PresetRow(ui, tileW = 150.dp, tileH = 96.dp)
+        // A short screen (a landscape tablet): the presets strip hides first, so the stage and the Rig keep their room
+        // (owner bug 2026-11-14 on the Mac: the prompt and the strip squeezed the Rig to two rows).
+        else if (ui.photo == null && ((presets && androidx.compose.ui.platform.LocalConfiguration.current.screenHeightDp >= 720) || ui.d.collapsed)) PresetRow(ui, tileW = 150.dp, tileH = 96.dp)
         Row(Modifier.weight(1f).fillMaxWidth(), horizontalArrangement = Arrangement.spacedBy(20.dp)) {
             // The redesign: the stage on the field tone, the Rig panel raised with a hairline edge.
             Box(Modifier.weight(1f).fillMaxHeight().then(Modifier.suiteStage()).padding(16.dp)) {
diff --git a/android/app/src/test/kotlin/studio/muse/app/SuiteLongPromptTest.kt b/android/app/src/test/kotlin/studio/muse/app/SuiteLongPromptTest.kt
